# Level 1, played the way a person plays it: stand, run right off the ledge
# and fall a row, run on over the loose floor, come back left, and press Up
# against the ledge. It covers standing, running, an unplanned fall, the
# landing, turning, a loose floor and a climb -- in one unbroken session,
# which is the point: the bugs being hunted appear after a few moves, not in
# the first one.
level 1
cycles 400
settle 40
phase - 4
phase r 10
phase - 4
phase r 8
phase - 4
phase l 6
phase - 3
phase u 8
phase - 4
